  "solution": {
    "text": "Case-I<br /><br />In equilibrium<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">up</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">mg</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mi>h</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0129_c1ee38987883.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 278px;\" /><br /><br />Case-II<br /><br />Let block is pressed by x more in liquid<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">mg</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">net</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">AL</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">net</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ah</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ax</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">AL</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>. . . . . . . . . . (2)<br /><br />from equation (1) &amp; (2)<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">net</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ax</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g&nbsp;</mi></math>restoring force in upward direction<br /><br /><math><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x for SHM</mi></math><br /><br />and <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />so <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />so <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>650</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>54</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>900</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cm</mi></math>"
